      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Mouth-guarded face refine (H3 v2v)\n\nSecond pass over a rendered H3 clip: 2x upscale, re-encode, and re-render toward the **face reference images** - while the **H3 Mouth Guard** protects the lips (and the soundtrack) from denoising, so the pass-1 lip-sync survives.\n\n**One-time setup**: download the face landmarker weights to `models/detection/mediapipe_face_fp32.safetensors` from\nhttps://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/mediapipe/resolve/main/detection/mediapipe_face_fp32.safetensors\n\n- `BasicScheduler.denoise` = refine strength (0.35-0.5). Keep **RandomNoise** - never a DisableNoise / pre-noised flow, the guard preserves the *input* latent.\n- Unmute the **A/B** group for a same-seed comparison without the guard.\n- Unmute the **composite** group to also paste the pass-1 mouth pixels back after decode.\n- Small faces: keep the 2x upscale; the mask engine works on 32-px cells."
      ],
      "title": "README"
    },
